The '''House of Zhifol''' ([[IPA]]: /ʒifol/; [[Qymish language|Qymish]]: Ⱄⰺⰿⱒⰰ ⰹⱋ Ⰶⰹⱇⱁⰾ, ''Symqa ish Zhifol''), also known as the '''House of Qym''', is the current [[wikipedia:dynasty|dynasty]] of [[Qym]]. 

The house takes its name from the [[Palace of Zhifol]], a castle built from {{abbr|1550|1288 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} to {{abbr|1555|1292 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} in [[REGION]] by [[DUDE]]. 

